WEBVTT

00:06:28.356 --> 00:06:31.716
meaning at least 30 percent of the planet,

00:06:31.716 --> 00:06:33.276
land and sea,

00:06:33.316 --> 00:06:34.996
protected by 2030.

00:06:36.156 --> 00:06:38.236
Working with the governments
of Costa Rica,

00:06:38.236 --> 00:06:40.196
France and the United Kingdom,

00:06:40.196 --> 00:06:44.276
we built the High Ambition Coalition
for Nature and People,

00:06:44.316 --> 00:06:47.796
which now has 66 countries
in it and growing,

00:06:47.836 --> 00:06:53.356
all supporting "30 by 30" as a main target
for a global deal on nature.

00:06:55.716 --> 00:06:58.596
Thirty percent of our planet by 2030.

00:06:59.036 --> 00:07:01.676
Only that amount of wild nature,